    "Budgets repeat every month. Reminders appear quietly inside the app once per budget when you approach or pass a limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预算每月循环。接近或超出额度时，每项预算只会在 App 内安静提醒一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預算每月循環。接近或超出額度時，每項預算只會在 App 內安靜提醒一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
