    "Required columns: Date and Amount. Optional: Type, Currency, Account, To Account, Category, Tags, Note. Chinese headers such as 日期, 金额, 分类 are recognised. Missing accounts and categories are created; duplicates are skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必需列：Date（日期）和 Amount（金额）。可选列：Type、Currency、Account、To Account、Category、Tags、Note。可识别「日期」「金额」「分类」等中文表头。缺少的账户和分类会自动创建，重复记录会跳过。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必需列：Date（日期）和 Amount（金額）。可選列：Type、Currency、Account、To Account、Category、Tags、Note。可識別「日期」「金額」「分類」等中文表頭。缺少的帳戶和分類會自動創建，重複記錄會跳過。"
